    <!--
        JitHub's renderer customization is expressed exclusively through the
        stable MarkdownResourceKeys contract. These redirects keep the brush
        instances owned by the app palette, so palette and contrast changes do
        not allocate a parallel MarkdownTheme graph for every viewer.
    -->
